[[4,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179002780.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,3,0,"<figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179002781.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,3,0,"<figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179002782.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Disconnect the rapid connectors for the intermediate and front return pipes from the fuel cooling device and release them from the retaining bands.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179002783.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,3,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolt (1a) and the nuts (1b) fixing the fuel cooling device and remove it.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179002784.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,3,0,"<p>1. Undo the retaining bolts.</p><p>2. Separate the duct (2a) and the radiator (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179002785.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Fit the radiator on the duct and tighten the fixing bolts.</p><p>- Fit the cooling device and tighten the fixing nuts and bolt.</p><p>- Connect the rapid connectors for the two fuel pipes.</p>"]]